{"unit_id":"code4lala__dsh-plugin-workspace-path#card-zh","repo":"code4lala/dsh-plugin-workspace-path","commit":"29cb9c0cf5b6fd62f2e3add8bcbe6b3b1d6d20df","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@code4lala/dsh-plugin-workspace-path 是一个 DSH Web 客户端插件：在侧边栏每个工作区标题下显示完整目录路径，并支持换行。它通过读取 workspaces 客户端服务的工作区快照，将路径副标题按列表位置插入对应行；工作区列表变化或侧边栏 DOM 更新时会重新同步。主要功能包括区分同名工作区、跟随重排和路径修改更新、忽略搜索结果行，以及在渲染行数不一致时清除旧路径。适合需要从侧栏辨认工作区目录的 DSH Web 用户。需要 DSH Web 提供 workspaces 服务，不需额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:85-121","lib/client.js:124-170"]}
{"unit_id":"code4lala__dsh-plugin-workspace-path#card-en","repo":"code4lala/dsh-plugin-workspace-path","commit":"29cb9c0cf5b6fd62f2e3add8bcbe6b3b1d6d20df","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@code4lala/dsh-plugin-workspace-path displays workspace directories under its DSH web sidebar title. It matches paths by row position, distinguishing duplicate titles, and refreshes them when workspace data or sidebar DOM changes. It clears labels during row mismatches. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:85-121","lib/client.js:124-170"]}
